# size: 1200x820
# Initial, populated, focused, disabled and modal states for the editor.
# The discard dialog is the one modal the review pass captured, and the
# enable/disable rules on Save and Revert are what tell a person whether their
# work is safe; neither is observable from a screenshot of the first frame.
expect-text Notes
expect-text No changes
expect-disabled Save
expect-disabled "Revert changes"
expect-history "Note text" 0
snapshot initial
type "Note text" hello
wait 400
expect-focused "Note text"
expect-value "Note text" hello
expect-enabled Save
expect-enabled "Revert changes"
snapshot edited
click New
wait 400
expect-onscreen #discard-confirmation
snapshot discard-dialog
